  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Looking for an international university with a global outlook and high academic standards? Middlesex University Mauritius could be the perfect place for you. It is part of the well-established Middlesex University network, offering a range of undergraduate and postgraduate degrees.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At the university, you’ll have many opportunities to meet new people, take part in events, and more. The Student Union offers support for your academic and personal journey, from mental health resources to career advice.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Middlesex University offers you a variety of modern, high-quality accommodation options. You can get comfortable stay options at their Uniciti Student Residences (USR), which is just a short walk from campus. You can choose from single En-suite rooms with private bathrooms, or go for an En-suite Plus room.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The Hornsey Library offers plenty of learning materials like books, newspapers, eBooks, and databases to help you succeed. With spaces for group study, silent study, and open study, it's your ideal place to study on campus.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>On campus, you’ll find a range of sports facilities and activities, including a Sports Centre for students to exercise and stay fit.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>You’ll have access to fully equipped labs, learning resources, and other specialist facilities for various fields of study.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
